        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>RFC 9086 - Segment Routing EPE BGP-LS Extensions</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: #262626;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 768px;\n      height: 1086px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      position: relative;\n      padding: 46px 72px 0 72px;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    .header {\n      height: 28px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\n      font-size: 12.5px;\n      line-height: 16px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .header .left { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; }\n    .header .center { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; text-align: center; }\n    .header .right { position: absolute; right: 1px; top: 0; }\n    .content {\n      margin: 18px 12px 0 12px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 18px;\n    }\n    p {\n      margin: 0 0 13px 0;\n    }\n    .intro {\n      margin-bottom: 22px;\n    }\n    h1, h2 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 20px;\n      line-height: 24px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    h1 { margin-bottom: 9px; }\n    h2 {\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 21px;\n      margin-top: 18px;\n      margin-bottom: 7px;\n    }\n    .section-number {\n      display: inline-block;\n      margin-right: 13px;\n    }\n    ul {\n      margin: 0 0 16px 17px;\n      padding: 0;\n      list-style-position: outside;\n    }\n    li {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    .table-wrap {\n      width: max-content;\n      margin: 10px auto 18px auto;\n    }\n    table {\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 18px;\n    }\n    th {\n      background: #e8e8e8;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      text-align: left;\n      padding: 6px 10px 5px 10px;\n      border: 1px solid #dddddd;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    td {\n      background: #fafafa;\n      padding: 6px 10px 5px 10px;\n      border: 1px solid #dddddd;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .protocol-table th:nth-child(1) { width: 94px; }\n    .protocol-table th:nth-child(2) { width: 242px; }\n    .protocol-table th:nth-child(3) { width: 91px; }\n    .descriptor-table th:nth-child(1) { width: 118px; }\n    .descriptor-table th:nth-child(2) { width: 192px; }\n    .descriptor-table th:nth-child(3) { width: 86px; }\n    caption {\n      caption-side: bottom;\n      text-align: left;\n      padding-top: 1px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-style: italic;\n      line-height: 17px;\n    }\n    .after-list {\n      margin-top: 1px;\n      margin-bottom: 13px;\n    }\n    .following {\n      margin-top: -1px;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 72px;\n      right: 72px;\n      bottom: 136px;\n      height: 29px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\n      font-size: 12.5px;\n      line-height: 18px;\n      padding-top: 11px;\n    }\n    .footer .left { position: absolute; left: 0; }\n    .footer .center { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; text-align: center; }\n    .footer .right { position: absolute; right: 1px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <span class=\"left\">RFC 9086</span>\n      <span class=\"center\">Segment Routing EPE BGP-LS Extensions</span>\n      <span class=\"right\">August 2021</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"content\">\n      <p class=\"intro\">The PeerSet SID TLV containing the same SID value (encoded as defined in <span style=\"color:#3434b7;\">Figure 2</span>) is included<br>in the BGP-LS Attribute for all of the BGP-LS Link NLRI corresponding to the PeerNode or<br>PeerAdj segments associated with the peer set.</p>\n\n      <h1><span class=\"section-number\">6.</span>IANA Considerations</h1>\n      <p>This document defines:</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>A new Protocol-ID: BGP. The code point is from the \"BGP-LS Protocol-IDs\" registry.</li>\n        <li>Two new TLVs: BGP-Router-ID and BGP Confederation Member. The code points are in the<br>\"BGP-LS Node Descriptor, Link Descriptor, Prefix Descriptor, and Attribute TLVs\" registry.</li>\n        <li>Three new BGP-LS Attribute TLVs: PeerNode SID, PeerAdj SID, and PeerSet SID. The code<br>points are in the \"BGP-LS Node Descriptor, Link Descriptor, Prefix Descriptor, and Attribute<br>TLVs\" registry.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h2><span class=\"section-number\">6.1.</span>New BGP-LS Protocol-ID</h2>\n      <p>This document defines a new value in the registry \"BGP-LS Protocol-IDs\":</p>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table class=\"protocol-table\">\n          <caption>Table 3: BGP-LS Protocol-ID</caption>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Protocol-ID</th>\n              <th>NLRI information source protocol</th>\n              <th>Reference</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td>7</td>\n              <td>BGP</td>\n              <td>RFC 9086</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2><span class=\"section-number\">6.2.</span>Node Descriptors and Link Attribute TLVs</h2>\n      <p>This document defines five new TLVs in the registry \"BGP-LS Node Descriptor, Link Descriptor,<br>Prefix Descriptor, and Attribute TLVs\":</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Two new Node Descriptor TLVs</li>\n        <li>Three new Link Attribute TLVs</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <p class=\"after-list\">All five of the new code points are in the same registry: \"BGP-LS Node Descriptor, Link<br>Descriptor, Prefix Descriptor, and Attribute TLVs\".</p>\n      <p>The following new Node Descriptor TLVs are defined:</p>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\" style=\"margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n        <table class=\"descriptor-table\">\n          <caption>Table 4: BGP-LS Descriptor TLV Code Points</caption>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>TLV Code Point</th>\n              <th>Description</th>\n              <th>Reference</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td>516</td>\n              <td>BGP Router-ID</td>\n              <td>RFC 9086</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>517</td>\n              <td>BGP Confederation Member</td>\n              <td>RFC 9086</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"following\">The following new Link Attribute TLVs are defined:</p>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <span class=\"left\">Previdi, et al.</span>\n      <span class=\"center\">Standards Track</span>\n      <span class=\"right\">Page 11</span>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
